# Keepass2Android, an open database at its root group: add an entry ${ENTRY} and save; if the save
# asks "Merge changes?", record the dialog and answer it as k2a-ans-${ANSWER}.flow does.
tap fabAddNew
tap fabAddNewEntry
maybe ^No$ 4                      # "Add templates?" on the first entry added
waitfor entry_title 20
tap entry_title
text ${ENTRY}
tap menu_save
ifthen Merge.changes 25 k2a-ans-${ANSWER}.flow
sleep 3
dialog
waitfor fabAddNew 60
sleep 4
list
